Source: https://github.com/bluenviron/mediamtx at 6d41178,
internal/recorder/format_fmp4*.go and internal/playback/muxer_mp4.go.

What is adapted from it (issue #817), in Go in internal/node/device
(segment.go): how its recorder writes H.264 into fragmented MP4 with
mediacommon (Annex B made AVCC, a 90 kHz timescale, fragments flushed by
size), and how its playback muxes a recording's fragments into a regular MP4
with mediacommon's pmp4 (one track, the samples read back as they are
written).
